%%{init: {'theme': 'dark', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#C2FF00', 'primaryTextColor': '#0F0F0F', 'primaryBorderColor': '#C2FF00', 'lineColor': '#8B5CF6', 'secondaryColor': '#1A1A1A', 'tertiaryColor': '#252525'}}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Fan
    participant MapView as FanMapView
    participant EventCard as EventCard Component
    participant Hook as useEventActions
    participant ConvexMutation as Convex Mutation
    participant ConvexDB as Convex Database
    participant OtherUsers as Other Connected Users

    Note over Fan,OtherUsers: Fan RSVP Flow

    %% Step 1: Fan discovers event
    Fan->>MapView: View map with events
    MapView->>MapView: Display event markers
    Fan->>MapView: Tap on event marker

    MapView->>EventCard: Show event details<br/>in info window

    %% Step 2: Check current RSVP status
    EventCard->>ConvexDB: useQuery(getUserEventStatus)
    ConvexDB-->>EventCard: { hasRsvp: false, hasLiked: false }
    EventCard->>EventCard: Render RSVP button<br/>(not active)

    %% Step 3: Fan decides to RSVP
    Fan->>EventCard: Click "RSVP" button
    EventCard->>EventCard: Set loading state
    EventCard->>Hook: Call rsvp(eventId)

    %% Step 4: Execute mutation
    Hook->>ConvexMutation: events.rsvp({ eventId })

    %% Step 5: Backend authentication
    ConvexMutation->>ConvexMutation: ctx.auth.getUserIdentity()

    alt Not authenticated
        ConvexMutation-->>Hook: Error: "Not authenticated"
        Hook-->>EventCard: Show error message
    else Authenticated
        ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Query user by clerkId
        ConvexDB-->>ConvexMutation: Return user record
    end

    %% Step 6: Check existing RSVP
    ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Query rsvps<br/>by_user_event index
    ConvexDB-->>ConvexMutation: Existing RSVP or null

    alt RSVP already exists (toggle off)
        ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Delete RSVP record
        ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Decrement event.rsvpCount
        ConvexDB-->>ConvexMutation: Updated event
        ConvexMutation-->>Hook: { action: "removed" }

        Note over ConvexDB: rsvpCount decreased by 1
    else No existing RSVP (toggle on)
        ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Insert RSVP record<br/>(userId, eventId, createdAt)
        ConvexMutation->>ConvexDB: Increment event.rsvpCount
        ConvexDB-->>ConvexMutation: Updated event
        ConvexMutation-->>Hook: { action: "added" }

        Note over ConvexDB: rsvpCount increased by 1
    end

    %% Step 7: Real-time updates propagate
    Hook-->>EventCard: Mutation complete
    EventCard->>EventCard: Clear loading state

    ConvexDB-->>MapView: Query subscription update
    MapView->>MapView: Re-render with new count

    ConvexDB-->>EventCard: getUserEventStatus update
    EventCard->>EventCard: Update RSVP button state<br/>(now active/inactive)

    %% Step 8: Other users see update
    ConvexDB-->>OtherUsers: Broadcast event update
    OtherUsers->>OtherUsers: UI shows new RSVP count

    %% Step 9: Calendar updates
    Fan->>MapView: Navigate to Calendar
    MapView->>ConvexDB: useQuery(getUserRsvps)
    ConvexDB-->>MapView: Return RSVP'd events

    alt RSVP was added
        MapView->>Fan: Show event in "My Events"
    else RSVP was removed
        MapView->>Fan: Event no longer in "My Events"
    end

    Note over Fan,OtherUsers: RSVP Complete - Real-time Sync
